"\\frac{\\widetilde{\\Phi}(u_{xx} = -0.005) - \\widetilde{\\Phi}(u_{\\mu "
"\\nu} = 0.0)}{-0.005}`,"
msgstr ":math:`= 0.5\\times \\frac{\\widetilde{\\Phi}(u_{xx} = 0.005) - \\widetilde{\\Phi}(u_{\\mu \\nu} = 0.0)}{0.005} + 0.5\\times \\frac{\\widetilde{\\Phi}(u_{xx} = -0.005) - \\widetilde{\\Phi}(u_{\\mu \\nu} = 0.0)}{-0.005}`,"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/zno_qha_relax.rst:115
msgid "the corresponding :red:`strain_harmonic.in` would be like ::"
msgstr "対応する :red:`strain_harmonic.in` は次のようになります。 ::"

